Section: 1. Introduction
Text: In this paper we contribute in this direction presenting the ﬁrst Greek annotated dataset for offensive language iden- tiﬁcation: the Offensive Greek Tweet Dataset (OGTD). OGTD uses a working deﬁnition of offensive language in- spired by the OLID dataset for English (Zampieri et al., 2019a) used in the recent OffensEval (SemEval-2019 Task 6) (Zampieri et al., 2019b).

