=== Auto: RAG Direct Answer ===
Yes. The OGTD tweets were manually annotated by a team of volunteers through an annotation platform [4]. The paper also reports inter-annotator agreement, keeping labels with 100% agreement and, in cases of disagreement, selecting labels with majority agreement above 66%; for complete disagreement, one of the authors reviewed the tweets with two extra human judges to reach the desired majority agreement above 66% [6].
